+# Full Project Implementation Report — Workintech Frontend Final E-Commerce (T02–T23)
+
+Run date: 2026-09-17 (TRT) · Builder: Claude Code (Opus 5) · Branch: `builder/full-project-run-20260917-1324` · Baseline: `30e27eb`
+
